  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gambia - Banjul-Serekunda Highway</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Gambie &#x2013; Projet d&#x2019;autoroute Banjul&#x2013;Serekunda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The construction contract was awarded in June 1986, with a completion period of 24 months and supervision was awarded on 5th March 1986. The work physically commenced on 1st September 1986. The contractor was suspended in 1989 in order to allow Government investigation of the course of the failed sections of the road. The contract was eventually terminated. The project remains nearly 60% completed with UA 13.44 million disbursed. There have not been any disbursements since 9th March 1989.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR"></narrative>
  </description>
